  "story": {
    "text": "The young people go to Lyme, to see Wentworth’s friend Captain Harville, {LAME} from the war, in a tiny {COTTAGE} by the sea. Harville makes the most of every corner: he {CARPENTERS}, glues and mends. With him lives Captain Benwick, {MOURNING} his fiancée, Harville’s sister Fanny. Anne advises him to read less {POETRY}, and more {PROSE}.",
